<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Create Water</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 16)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast create water</a>
</pre>
<p>Creates a barrel full of clear, fresh water for the thirsty. It's yours to 
carry: drink from it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>), or fill your own water skin from it 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Fill</a>). It weighs a little, so drop it when it's empty.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on staffs, scrolls and wands. For 
something to eat, see <a cmd='#'>Help Create Food</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fill</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Create Food</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>